      "value": "I've seen Hue control on avatar, haven't seen RGB. Maybe a concept avatar would go well with this request. Could give user choice between the 4 radial puppet mode, or three individual puppets. Like both method use same floats\n\nYou could also show a color sample attached to head like \"heads up display\" to help selection.",
