      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: RGB could be done on an avatar, but would use 3 radial puppets, and the user would have to change each colour value individually to get what they want. A colour picker would make it much easier to select the colour. Chilloutvr has something like this, and even implementing it into an avatar with what we have would be much more difficult than a native colour picker",
