      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6019aabeb2aa9863d06247ae|full_name}: I was thinking that if you make an avatar do this the hard way on a publicly accessible avatar, it could be useful tool to show off the idea.\n\nHave a sub menu for the color, and have three radial puppets for RGB value, and then a 4 axis puppet that will set RGB and a throw away value. You might need slightly customized shader to accept separate RGB values for input. The purpose for the avatar is for other people to try out and hopefully agree with your feature request.\n\nFinding or making a clip showing the native color selection in chill out might be enough. Knobs to turn might be worth more",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
