  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-03-06T01:56:00.282Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add a colour picker into the SDK3 Avatars, that allows the addition of a colour selector, that can change any colour or vector3 value on the avatar. This can technically be done with 3 radial puppets for red green and blue, but is both annoying to set up and annoying to use, and there's no in game display of what the colour the user picking is, they have to individually change each value until they get the colour they want.",
